# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules

# Ignore the Vite build output, but keep dist/.gitkeep tracked: it is what makes
# the `//go:embed all:dist` directive in ui/embed.go valid on a fresh clone, so
# `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` work without running `yarn build` first.
# (A bare `dist` rule ignores the directory itself, and a negation cannot
# re-include a file inside an ignored directory — hence `dist/*`.)
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
